              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it shows",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The project split into a WBS (phase → work package), each with a budget, and whether the project is on budget and on schedule.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Three numbers (earned value)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "PV: what we planned to spend by now",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "EV: budget of the work actually done (BAC × % complete)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "AC: what we actually spent",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "CPI = EV ÷ AC (below 1 = over budget)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "SPI = EV ÷ PV (below 1 = behind schedule)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Try this (PRJ-102)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• The engineering run (2.2) needed rework in June–July: actual 300k vs 200k budget.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• EAC went 1.5M → 1.8M (June) → 2.0M (Oct, incl. change order). BAC is 1.7M incl. the CO, so VAC = −300k.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• CPI 0.85: each dollar spent delivered 85 cents of planned work.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• The change order has its own WBS line (6.1) and budget, so the extra scope never hides the overrun.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Compare",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "PRJ-101 is the clean project: CPI = 1.00, VAC = 0. PRJ-103 (batches) has no EAC, so EV, CPI and SPI are blank: its revenue is not cost-based.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
